},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/DockBeauty/Screenshots/5.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 5"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 12,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Dynamic Animations:** Icon waves, breathing effects, fish tank, fireflies, and various shake motions.\n- **Streamer & Glow:** Customizable light streamers and icon glow effects.\n- **Seasonal Particles & Bubbles:** Bubble effects and seasonal/holiday emoji particles.\n- **Dock Customization:** Adjust opacity, corner radius (fully transparent Dock) and icon sizes.\n- **Touch Feedback:** Ripple and physics bounce effects on interaction.\n- **Preset Management:** Save presets and auto-switch based on day/night hours.\n- **Battery Saving:** Automatically reduces load on low battery and is compatible with Reduce Motion.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
